    "Can a skilled worker start a new batch of trainees in week 2 (i.e., overlapping with a batch that started in week 1), as long as the total number of trainees started in any two consecutive weeks does not exceed 3?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for a specific policy constraint regarding overlapping training batches."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
